// Ch12 side errand (optional; requires ch12_ram_felled). The red herd-cord the party cut from the Ram's fleece
// belonged to Dorro, the herder in ch12_bark_herder. His daughter takes it. She does not keep it; she will tie it on the
// pass. The Ullari way, stated without comment. Sets ch12_returned_herd_cord.
title: ch12_side_dorros_cord
location: ch12/quellan
---
Ullari_woman as "Dorro's daughter" [neutral]: That's my father's cord. Red, with the double knot. He tied it on her the spring she was born. #line:ch12_dcord_001 #long
Asha [sad]: I'm sorry. About her. And him. #line:ch12_dcord_002
Ullari_woman as "Dorro's daughter" [neutral]: She went wild after he died. Nobody walked her home. #line:ch12_dcord_003
Ullari_woman as "Dorro's daughter" [neutral]: I'll tie it on the pass, next to his. Then they're both on the road together. #line:ch12_dcord_004
<<set $ch12_returned_herd_cord = true>>
===
